 * Cache for `_cachedResolveZoneIdText`.
 *
 * Its basic structure is:
 * Obj { locale: zoneId }
 * Obj { zoneId: style}
 * Obj { style: type}
 * Obj { type: metazone}
 * Obj { metazone: resolvedZoneIdText}
 *
 * A resolved text may be undefined, if there is no text for the zone.

